{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Scale approximate nearest neighbor (ANN) retrieval using Hierarchical Navigable Small World graphs with empirical logarithmic query scaling under navigable graph structure."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When vector collections expand beyond tens of thousands of items, exact (O(N \\cdot d)) linear scans become a major latency bottleneck for real-time recommendation and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) systems."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"HNSWIndex","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" actor provides a hierarchical graph-based spatial partitioning index with low query latency and empirical (O(\\log N \\cdot M \\cdot d)) search scaling on well-behaved distributions of bounded intrinsic dimensionality (with recall\/work traded explicitly via ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"M"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"efConstruction","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"efSearch"},{"type":"text","text":", rather than a worst-case logarithmic bound in arbitrary dimensions)."}]},{"anchor":"Hierarchical-Navigable-Small-World-Architecture","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Hierarchical Navigable Small World Architecture"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"HNSW constructs a hierarchy of graph layers:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Top Layers (Sparse)","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Contain widely spaced long-range highway edges for rapid coarse geometric routing across distant clusters."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Intermediate Layers","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Progressively decrease edge length while increasing vertex density."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Bottom Layer (Layer 0, Dense)"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Contains all indexed vertices connected by dense short-range edges for high-accuracy localized nearest-neighbor refinement.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"code":["Layer 2 (Express):   [A] ───────────────────────────► [F]","                      │                                │","                      ▼                                ▼","Layer 1 (Regional):  [A] ──────────► [C] ────────────► [F]","                      │               │                │","                      ▼               ▼                ▼","Layer 0 (Base):      [A] ──► [B] ──► [C] ──► [D] ──► [E] ──► [F]"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":null},{"anchor":"Key-Configuration-Parameters","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Key Configuration Parameters"},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Parameter","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Recommended Default","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Impact on Search Quality & Index Build Time","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"M","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"16","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Maximum outgoing connections per node. Higher values improve recall at the cost of higher memory and index construction time.","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"efConstruction","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"200"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Size of dynamic candidate evaluation queue during insertion. Larger values produce higher-quality graph connectivity."}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"efSearch"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"50"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Dynamic queue size during search traversal. Higher values increase search recall towards 100% exact match."}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"metric"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".euclideanDistance"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Choice of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".euclideanDistance"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".cosineSimilarity"},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".dotProduct"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]]],"header":"row","type":"table","alignments":["left","left","left"]},{"level":2,"text":"Example Usage","anchor":"Example-Usage","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import SwiftCluster","","\/\/ 1. Initialize the actor-isolated index","let hnsw = HNSWIndex(metric: .cosineSimilarity, M: 16, efConstruction: 200, efSearch: 50)","","\/\/ 2. Add embeddings asynchronously","await hnsw.add(id: \"doc_news_1\", vector: [0.12, 0.94, -0.31], metadata: [\"category\": \"news\"])","await hnsw.add(id: \"doc_tech_2\", vector: [-0.85, 0.11, 0.52], metadata: [\"category\": \"technology\"])","","\/\/ 3. Query Top-K nearest neighbors","let queryEmbedding = [0.10, 0.90, -0.30]","let matches = await hnsw.search(query: queryEmbedding, topK: 5)","","for match in matches {","    print(\"Matched: \\(match.id) with score: \\(match.score)\")","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":2,"text":"Thread Safety & Swift 6 Strict Concurrency","anchor":"Thread-Safety--Swift-6-Strict-Concurrency","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"HNSWIndex","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is implemented as an isolated Swift "},{"code":"actor","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", guaranteeing thread safety and eliminating race conditions when multiple background tasks insert items or execute queries concurrently."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"SwiftCluster"}],"roleHeading":"API Collection","role":"collectionGroup","title":"High-Dimensional Vector Search with HNSW"},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/HNSWVectorSearch","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Spatial-Indexing","title":"Spatial Indexing","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/HNSWIndex","doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/VectorMetric","doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/VectorSearchResult"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Guides--Tutorials","title":"Guides & Tutorials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/DimensionalityReduction","doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/ClusteringAndOutliers","doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/VectorStoreAndRAG"],"generated":true}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftcluster\/hnswvectorsearch"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"article","references":{"doc://SwiftCluster/documentation/SwiftCluster/ClusteringAndOutliers":{"kind":"article","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swiftcluster\/clusteringandoutliers","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/ClusteringAndOutliers","title":"Spatial Indexing, Clustering & Outlier Detection","role":"article","abstract":[{"text":"High-performance clustering and density-based anomaly detection powered by ","type":"text"},{"code":"KDTree","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"DBSCAN","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"KMeans","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"LocalOutlierFactor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"code":"IsolationForest","type":"codeVoice"}